<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Heavy - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Heavy - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.18 trln	 vs	    1.07 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   83.83		vs	   80.79</p>
<p> Current	     89.14		vs	   79.17</p>
<p> Net		   56.93		vs	   45.59</p>
<p> EPS		   16.88 yen	  vs	   13.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   3.37 billion	  vs	3.37 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd is a major heavy machinery maker.</p>
